cting multiple nodes in the SceneTree dock with control-clicking, that works ok for me, seems to be specific to the Project Manager list.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSelect one (or multiple using shift) projects in Project Manager, then control-click an unselected project, removing the original selection.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111972/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}